{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-cd-platform-design","title":"CI/CD 平台设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-toolchain/ci-cd-platform-design","wordCount":828,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-平台设计\">CI/CD 平台设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CI/CD 平台是平台工程中使用频率最高的基础设施。每个开发者每天都会与 CI/CD 系统交互多次——从代码提交到构建、测试、部署，CI/CD 流水线贯穿整个交付流程。平台工程视角下的 CI/CD 不再是各团队各自维护的脚本集合，而是一个标准化、可扩展的平台服务。</p>\n<p>平台化的 CI/CD 设计需要解决三个核心问题：标准化（统一流水线模板降低认知负荷）、多租户（隔离不同团队的构建环境和资源）和性能优化（构建缓存和并行化缩短反馈时间）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[CI 流水线]&#10;    B --&gt; C[代码质量检查]&#10;    B --&gt; D[构建与测试]&#10;    B --&gt; E[安全扫描]&#10;    C --&gt; F{质量门禁}&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|通过| G[制品发布]&#10;    F --&gt;|失败| H[反馈到 PR]&#10;    G --&gt; I[CD 流水线]&#10;    I --&gt; J[预发布部署]&#10;    J --&gt; K[生产发布]\">graph LR\n    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[CI 流水线]\n    B --&gt; C[代码质量检查]\n    B --&gt; D[构建与测试]\n    B --&gt; E[安全扫描]\n    C --&gt; F{质量门禁}\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|通过| G[制品发布]\n    F --&gt;|失败| H[反馈到 PR]\n    G --&gt; I[CD 流水线]\n    I --&gt; J[预发布部署]\n    J --&gt; K[生产发布]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>团队自建 CI/CD</th>\n<th>平台化 CI/CD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流水线定义</td>\n<td>每团队独立编写</td>\n<td>共享模板 + 团队定制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建环境</td>\n<td>共享 Runner</td>\n<td>多租户隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存策略</td>\n<td>无或简单</td>\n<td>分层缓存（依赖/构建/镜像）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全扫描</td>\n<td>各自集成</td>\n<td>平台统一集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>制品管理</td>\n<td>分散存储</td>\n<td>统一制品仓库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈速度</td>\n<td>无优化</td>\n<td>并行化 + 增量构建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流水线即代码\">流水线即代码</h2><p>流水线即代码（Pipeline as Code）是 CI/CD 平台化的基础。流水线定义存储在代码仓库中，与应用代码一起版本化管理。平台团队提供共享模板，开发者通过组合和定制来满足特定需求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 平台提供的共享流水线模板&#10;# .github/workflows/platform-ci.yml&#10;name: Platform CI&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  ci:&#10;    uses: platform-org/ci-templates/.github/workflows/typescript-service.yml@v3&#10;    with:&#10;      node-version: &#39;20&#39;&#10;      test-command: &#39;pnpm test&#39;&#10;      lint-command: &#39;pnpm lint&#39;&#10;      build-command: &#39;pnpm build&#39;&#10;      docker-registry: &#39;registry.example.com&#39;&#10;      helm-chart: &#39;charts/service&#39;&#10;    secrets: inherit\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 平台提供的共享流水线模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/platform-ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Platform CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ci</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">platform-org/ci-templates/.github/workflows/typescript-service.yml@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'20'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      test-command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm test'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      lint-command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm lint'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      build-command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm build'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      docker-registry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'registry.example.com'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      helm-chart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'charts/service'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    secrets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">inherit</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PipelineTemplateDesign {&#10;  layeredTemplates: {&#10;    base: {&#10;      scope: &#39;所有项目共用&#39;;&#10;      includes: [&#39;checkout&#39;, &#39;缓存恢复&#39;, &#39;依赖安装&#39;, &#39;安全扫描&#39;];&#10;    };&#10;    language: {&#10;      scope: &#39;按语言分类&#39;;&#10;      examples: [&#39;typescript-service&#39;, &#39;java-springboot&#39;, &#39;go-service&#39;];&#10;      includes: [&#39;编译&#39;, &#39;单元测试&#39;, &#39;lint&#39;, &#39;构建镜像&#39;];&#10;    };&#10;    deployment: {&#10;      scope: &#39;按部署策略分类&#39;;&#10;      examples: [&#39;canary-deploy&#39;, &#39;blue-green-deploy&#39;, &#39;rolling-deploy&#39;];&#10;      includes: [&#39;部署、健康检查、回滚策略&#39;];&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  customization: {&#10;    override: &#39;开发者可覆盖模板中的步骤参数&#39;;&#10;    extend: &#39;通过 pre/post hooks 添加自定义步骤&#39;;&#10;    escape: &#39;完全自定义流水线（需审批）&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  versioning: {&#10;    strategy: &#39;语义化版本（v1, v2, v3）&#39;;&#10;    migration: &#39;主版本升级提供迁移指南&#39;;&#10;    deprecation: &#39;旧版本保留 6 个月&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PipelineTemplateDesign</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  layeredTemplates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '所有项目共用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      includes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'缓存恢复'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'依赖安装'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'安全扫描'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    language</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '按语言分类'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      examples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'typescript-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'java-springboot'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'go-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      includes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'编译'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'单元测试'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'构建镜像'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    deployment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '按部署策略分类'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      examples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'canary-deploy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'blue-green-deploy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rolling-deploy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      includes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'部署、健康检查、回滚策略'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  customization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    override</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '开发者可覆盖模板中的步骤参数'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    extend</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '通过 pre/post hooks 添加自定义步骤'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    escape</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '完全自定义流水线（需审批）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  versioning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '语义化版本（v1, v2, v3）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    migration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '主版本升级提供迁移指南'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    deprecation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '旧版本保留 6 个月'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模板设计的关键原则是&quot;合理默认、允许覆盖&quot;。80% 的项目应该可以直接使用模板而无需修改，剩余 20% 通过参数覆盖或自定义 hooks 满足特殊需求。如果超过 30% 的项目需要大量定制，说明模板设计需要改进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多租户-ci-设计\">多租户 CI 设计</h2><p>多租户是平台化 CI 的关键挑战。不同团队共享 CI 基础设施时，需要确保资源隔离、安全隔离和性能公平。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 多租户 CI 架构&#10;        A[团队 A 流水线] --&gt; D[调度器]&#10;        B[团队 B 流水线] --&gt; D&#10;        C[团队 C 流水线] --&gt; D&#10;        D --&gt; E[Runner 池 A&lt;br&gt;高优先级]&#10;        D --&gt; F[Runner 池 B&lt;br&gt;标准]&#10;        D --&gt; G[Runner 池 C&lt;br&gt;自定义]&#10;    end&#10;    E --&gt; H[构建缓存 A]&#10;    F --&gt; I[共享构建缓存]&#10;    G --&gt; J[构建缓存 C]\">graph TB\n    subgraph 多租户 CI 架构\n        A[团队 A 流水线] --&gt; D[调度器]\n        B[团队 B 流水线] --&gt; D\n        C[团队 C 流水线] --&gt; D\n        D --&gt; E[Runner 池 A&lt;br&gt;高优先级]\n        D --&gt; F[Runner 池 B&lt;br&gt;标准]\n        D --&gt; G[Runner 池 C&lt;br&gt;自定义]\n    end\n    E --&gt; H[构建缓存 A]\n    F --&gt; I[共享构建缓存]\n    G --&gt; J[构建缓存 C]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MultiTenantCI {&#10;  resourceIsolation: {&#10;    runnerPools: {&#10;      strategy: &#39;按团队或优先级分配专用 Runner 池&#39;;&#10;      sizing: &#39;基于历史使用量自动扩缩容&#39;;&#10;      fairScheduling: &#39;防止单团队垄断所有资源&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    buildEnvironment: {&#10;      containerIsolation: &#39;每次构建使用独立容器&#39;;&#10;      networkIsolation: &#39;构建容器无法访问其他团队资源&#39;;&#10;      secretIsolation: &#39;团队 Secret 仅该团队流水线可访问&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  quotaManagement: {&#10;    concurrentBuilds: {&#10;      default: 5;&#10;      critical: 10;&#10;      experimental: 2;&#10;    };&#10;    maxBuildDuration: {&#10;      default: &#39;30 分钟&#39;;&#10;      extended: &#39;60 分钟（需申请）&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    storageQuota: {&#10;      cache: &#39;每团队 50GB&#39;;&#10;      artifacts: &#39;每团队 100GB&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  costAllocation: {&#10;    method: &#39;按构建分钟数和资源消耗归属到团队&#39;;&#10;    reporting: &#39;月度成本报告 → 团队负责人&#39;;&#10;    optimization: &#39;识别高成本流水线并建议优化&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MultiTenantCI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  resourceIsolation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    runnerPools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      strategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '按团队或优先级分配专用 Runner 池'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      sizing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '基于历史使用量自动扩缩容'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      fairScheduling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '防止单团队垄断所有资源'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    buildEnvironment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      containerIsolation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '每次构建使用独立容器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      networkIsolation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '构建容器无法访问其他团队资源'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      secretIsolation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '团队 Secret 仅该团队流水线可访问'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  quotaManagement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    concurrentBuilds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      critical</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      experimental</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxBuildDuration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '30 分钟'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      extended</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '60 分钟（需申请）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    storageQuota</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      cache</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '每团队 50GB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      artifacts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '每团队 100GB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  costAllocation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '按构建分钟数和资源消耗归属到团队'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reporting</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '月度成本报告 → 团队负责人'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    optimization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '识别高成本流水线并建议优化'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多租户 CI 的关键决策是共享 Runner 还是专用 Runner。共享 Runner 成本低但存在&quot;邻居噪音&quot;问题（一个团队的大量构建影响其他团队）；专用 Runner 隔离好但成本高。推荐的策略是：默认共享 + 关键服务专用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"构建缓存与性能优化\">构建缓存与性能优化</h2><p>构建速度直接影响开发者反馈循环。平台工程的目标是将 CI 构建时间控制在 10 分钟以内。分层缓存和并行化是最有效的优化手段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BuildOptimization {&#10;  layeredCaching: {&#10;    dependencyCache: {&#10;      what: &#39;npm/pnpm/maven 依赖缓存&#39;;&#10;      key: &#39;lockfile hash&#39;;&#10;      hitRate: &#39;&gt; 95%&#39;;&#10;      savings: &#39;节省 2-5 分钟&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    buildCache: {&#10;      what: &#39;编译产物缓存（Turborepo, Nx）&#39;;&#10;      key: &#39;源文件 hash&#39;;&#10;      hitRate: &#39;&gt; 70%&#39;;&#10;      savings: &#39;节省 3-10 分钟&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    dockerLayerCache: {&#10;      what: &#39;Docker 层缓存&#39;;&#10;      key: &#39;Dockerfile + 依赖 hash&#39;;&#10;      hitRate: &#39;&gt; 80%&#39;;&#10;      savings: &#39;节省 5-15 分钟&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    remoteCache: {&#10;      what: &#39;跨 CI 运行共享的远程缓存&#39;;&#10;      tool: &#39;Turborepo Remote Cache / Gradle Build Cache&#39;;&#10;      benefit: &#39;不同 PR 间共享编译结果&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  parallelization: {&#10;    testSharding: &#39;将测试套件分片到多个 Runner 并行执行&#39;;&#10;    matrixBuilds: &#39;多平台/多版本并行构建&#39;;&#10;    pipelineStages: &#39;无依赖的阶段并行执行&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  incrementalBuilds: {&#10;    affectedOnly: &#39;只构建和测试受变更影响的模块&#39;;&#10;    tool: &#39;Nx affected / Turborepo --filter&#39;;&#10;    savings: &#39;Monorepo 场景下节省 50-80% 构建时间&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BuildOptimization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  layeredCaching</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    dependencyCache</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      what</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'npm/pnpm/maven 依赖缓存'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lockfile hash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      hitRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '> 95%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      savings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '节省 2-5 分钟'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    buildCache</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      what</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '编译产物缓存（Turborepo, Nx）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '源文件 hash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span