\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    docker_build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C; 3 分钟'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  reliability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    success_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'> 95%（排除代码错误）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    flaky_test_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C; 1%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    infrastructure_failure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C; 0.1%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  optimization_actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    slow_builds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      detection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'P95 构建时间 > 15 分钟'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'分析构建日志，识别瓶颈步骤'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    flaky_tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      detection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'同一测试在不同运行中结果不一致'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'隔离到 flaky 套件，标记并修复'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cache_miss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      detection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'缓存命中率 &#x3C; 80%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'检查缓存 key 策略和存储容量'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>构建性能的持续监控同样重要。平台团队应该追踪构建时间趋势、缓存命中率和失败原因分布。当构建时间出现退化时，应该主动介入而非等待开发者投诉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((CI/CD 平台设计))&#10;    流水线即代码&#10;      分层模板&#10;      合理默认&#10;      允许覆盖&#10;    多租户&#10;      Runner 池隔离&#10;      配额管理&#10;      成本归属&#10;    性能优化&#10;      分层缓存&#10;      并行化&#10;      增量构建&#10;    质量门禁&#10;      代码质量&#10;      安全扫描&#10;      测试覆盖\">mindmap\n  root((CI/CD 平台设计))\n    流水线即代码\n      分层模板\n      合理默认\n      允许覆盖\n    多租户\n      Runner 池隔离\n      配额管理\n      成本归属\n    性能优化\n      分层缓存\n      并行化\n      增量构建\n    质量门禁\n      代码质量\n      安全扫描\n      测试覆盖</pre><ul>\n<li>CI/CD 平台化的核心是标准化模板 + 多租户隔离 + 性能优化</li>\n<li>流水线模板采用分层设计：基础层 → 语言层 → 部署策略层</li>\n<li>多租户隔离包括资源隔离、安全隔离和成本归属</li>\n<li>分层缓存（依赖→构建→Docker 层）是缩短构建时间的最有效手段</li>\n<li>CI 构建时间目标：完整流水线 &lt; 10 分钟，单元测试 &lt; 5 分钟</li>\n<li>持续监控构建性能趋势，主动识别和修复退化问题</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI/CD 平台设计","id":"ci-cd-平台设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"流水线即代码","id":"流水线即代码"},{"level":2,"text":"多租户 CI 设计","id":"多租户-ci-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"构建缓存与性能优化","id":"构建缓存与性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"入职自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/developer-portal/onboarding-automation"},"next":{"title":"容器编排平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-toolchain/container-orchestration-platform"}}